el Peace Prize in 2002 for his efforts to find peaceful solutions to international conflicts.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ad36-7747-b7ca-54daa62b87d4","description":"Jimmy Carter","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ad36-7118-bf00-51927c107eae","description":"George W. Bush","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad36-7b2c-b215-b5bc4755681c","description":"Ronald Reagan","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad36-74f0-a31f-2b46677f0232","description":"Grover Cleveland","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ad36-737c-8a77-69cf06b1bb97","category":"01a21312-b489-7ebc-94f2-41649ebfcaca","question":"Which WWII general was nicknamed \'The Desert Fox\'?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Rommel led the Afrika Korps in North Africa, where his campaigns made him well known to Allied forces.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ad36-75ce-a4a2-b1896212b775","description":"Rommel","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ad36-77f2-bf00-be4cb1e3dba3","description":"MacArthur","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad36-7388-ac20-8713fd0fd1dd","description":"Montgomery","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad36-7903-a046-e2e610bcfa96","description":"Zhukov","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ad36-74b5-b1b1-cad7935ccce6","category":"01a21312-b489-7ebc-94f2-41649ebfcaca","question":"Who was the 15th president of the USA, in term during the period 1857\u20131861?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"James Buchanan was the last president before Abraham Lincoln; the secession crisis deepened during Buchanan\u2019s term.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ad36-7c8b-9232-abd7cf6d0b0b","description":"James Buchanan","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ad36-7f0d-82b0-ce932b849154","description":"Rutherford B. Hayes","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad36-7402-827e-a24a73f975b3","description":"Woodrow Wilson","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ad36-73cd-91bf-22ded94ba236","description":"Abraham Lincoln","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ad36-72a1-a988-f2c0e38